-*   **Input:** Low-resolution 3D volume data ($V_{LR}$). In the cited implementation, this data is the output of an INR module evaluated at specific grid coordinates [S1].
-*   **Output:** High-resolution 3D volume ($y$) with enhanced detail and reduced artifacts [S1].
+*   **Input:** Low-resolution volumetric data sampled from the INR output [S1].
+*   **Output:** High-resolution volume $y$ with denoised features, restored to a resolution close to the original ground truth $x$ [S1].
 
